    {
      "id": "emergent_global_south_ai_initiative",
      "description": "In response to the EU's stalled access policy and rising AI protectionism in the US and China, a consortium of Global South nations announces a new open-science AI initiative hosted in Brazil and Kenya, leveraging distributed compute and federated learning to build regionally aligned models. The project gains unexpected traction as several EU research institutes quietly express interest in participation, seeking alternatives to American-dominated ecosystems.",
      "first_turn": 13,
